"Central Crescent is the branch of Anesidora's healing hospital system closest to Celena North."
"Its halls are pale blue and white."
"A separate emergency building takes patients the System deems too dangerous for other hospitals."
"It has a walk-in clinic, patient floors, a cafeteria, waiting rooms and a gift shop."
"Its potion dispensary has gray metal cabinets whose cubbies drop vials, behind a hall window."
"The wizard Ladda-ser, Master of Healing Objects for Humans, runs its potions from her workshop."
"Volunteers log in with 'System, loop me in at Central Crescent Healing Hospital'."
"Alden volunteers there, badged as the 'Pause Button Rabbit'."
